  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492540/diamond-spheres-harmony-and-discord?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Harmony &amp; Discord</a></sup></p>\n<p>Attempt a Bluff or Intimidate check against the creature’s demoralize DC. If you succeed, the target gains a circumstance bonus to initiative and Perception checks equal to 2, +1 per 6 ranks in the associated skill, and a -2 penalty to saving throws against fear effects. This lasts for 10 minutes per rank you possess in the associated skill. This is a fear effect. While a creature benefiting from this quip is shaken, frightened, or panicked, they gain a +4 dodge bonus to AC against attacks of opportunity and a +10-foot circumstance bonus to all speeds.</p>\n<p>Whenever a creature benefitting from this quip attempts an initiative check, they can move up to 10 feet +5 feet per 5 ranks in the associated skill as an immediate action (to a maximum distance equal to their speed). If the creature can perceive a threat, this movement must be away from that threat or otherwise towards safety (subject to GM discretion).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bluster#toc39\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
